        "mode": "tldr",
        "content": "GOOG remains in post-earnings extension regime (run 20260505_164543, May 5 2026). Price $383.51 \u2014 essentially flat from May 4's $383.22. The key development: RSI-7 eased from 97.47 to 90.69 and Z-score from 2.96 to 2.56, suggesting the daily extreme is very slowly unwinding while price holds its level. ADX increased further to 71.68 (+DI 43.64 vs \u2212DI 3.80), confirming the uptrend's strength has intensified. No-chase zone above $358 remains in force. Hourly RSI-21 normalized to 54.93 (was 79.28), and hourly OBV divergence has resolved \u2014 the intraday picture has cooled materially, removing the prior \"early distribution\" signal. Mean-reversion short (Branch A) thesis reaffirmed but no reversal candle confirmed. (Source: swing_mean_reversion, swing_trend_momentum, swing_head_trader, run 20260505_164543)",
